WEBVTT

00:00:00.510 --> 00:00:05.000
[Playful orchestral music]

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.500
A llama stands on a frozen pond. A small plant with red berries pokes through the ice.

00:00:07.510 --> 00:00:10.500
[The llama grunts]

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:14.500
The llama stretches towards the berries, and its legs slide apart.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:18.000
It falls flat on its belly, its nose just short of the plant.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
A grey penguin chick waddles up and eats the berries, one by one.

00:00:18.010 --> 00:00:20.500
[The chick squeaks]

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:30.500
The llama glares at the chick. Only leaves are left.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:36.500
A steam train thunders along a track through the snow.

00:00:31.510 --> 00:00:35.000
[A steam whistle blows]

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:42.500
The chick has found another berry plant, between the rails. The train is coming.

00:00:37.510 --> 00:00:42.000
[The music builds]

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:45.000
The llama leaps and knocks the chick off the track as the train roars past.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:47.500
The llama sits among splintered planks, the berry on the tip of its tongue.

00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:53.000
The chick peers over the rail, and stares.

00:00:52.510 --> 00:00:58.500
[Wood cracks and breaks]

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:56.500
The chick takes the berry. Then the planks under them give way.

00:00:56.500 --> 00:01:01.500
They land in a dark mine. A huge bunch of berries hangs above them.

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:07.500
In a mine cart, they rattle through the cavern. The chick holds on to the berries.

00:01:03.010 --> 00:01:08.000
[Rumbling and crashing]

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:14.000
The cart bursts out into daylight, on a wooden track along the mountain.

00:01:12.010 --> 00:01:19.500
[Crashes]

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:19.000
The llama looks ahead. The track ends.

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:25.000
They fly through the air, high above the clouds, the berries just out of reach.

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:29.500
The chick tumbles past the llama's open mouth.

00:01:29.500 --> 00:01:33.500
The llama looks down.

00:01:33.010 --> 00:01:35.500
[Thuds]

00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:37.000
It tumbles past jagged peaks and rolls into deep snow.

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:43.000
The llama lies dazed, a bump on its head. The chick hops off its back and walks away.

00:01:40.510 --> 00:01:47.000
[The chick calls]

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:50.500
Alone, the llama watches it go.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:58.000
Evening. The llama sits on a cliff above the sea, beside a lighthouse.

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:04.000
The chick comes back with a bunch of berries. Behind it walks a whole colony of penguins, each carrying more.

00:01:58.510 --> 00:02:03.000
[Penguins chatter]

00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:06.000
The llama beams.

00:02:04.510 --> 00:02:14.000
[Gentle music]

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:09.000
A heap of berries and fish lies by the chick's nest.

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:14.000
Night falls. The llama rests among the penguins, next to the chick.

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:16.000
The lighthouse sweeps its beam across the sky.

00:02:16.010 --> 00:02:29.000
[Music]

